 it! So try that first if you have a fresh sunscreen stain \u2014 always treat stains immediately and allow the stain remover time to work.", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T19:42:38.000Z", "videoDuration": 54.077824, "videoPlayCount": 306376, "videoViewCount": 103640, "likesCount": 2479, "commentsCount": 134, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/763374341_18378838825224351_3055382845167878882_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ig_cache_key=Mzk1NjUwNjQ5MjI5MzY0OTE4ODE4Mzc4ODM4ODE5MjI0MzUx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=Tk6CaKW6mtwQ7kNvwH-v2VY&_nc_oc=AdplqAG9yPeoE0GUHpOStc0OajGIvVREW_SupkMfNwEiQubDpRI6go6bz7L6zBPvbjU&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=2zueJJOvEzQRNUkKTquQKg&_nc_ss=7c689&oh=00_AQHJ0aVQYSML0w_ytVCLQZJEddfnwIz9t0t64-FAIOg79A&oe=6A90AF6D", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPKG6fqZfGRA701l2Nu1ilZ7z5IbXIBsvpUAq-FqGGrYRCGLgNX9d3yApXZAH1sPJTmbVo6tHeluPIdyFfX5STDVspfycVCG7xh6Zk.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=CAUjIoHs1N0Q7kNvwE9V_qh&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTA3MDUwMzExMjU4MzUwOCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE4LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDgyNywiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6NTQsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=b70f52071474f764&_nc_&_nc_gid=2zueJJOvEzQRNUkKTquQKg&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQHH4bpglkMjmvlmHEta-qRS8u95R6HFDvrMSNJ0ExmJyQ&oe=6A8CC42E", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "gocleanco", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "37289689417312501"}, "ownerUsername": "gocleanco", "ownerFullName": "Sarah McAllister", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-09", "plays": 265435, "likes": 2161, "comments": 122}, {"date": "2026-08-16", "plays": 299265, "likes": 2428, "comments": 133}, {"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 306376, "likes": 2479, "comments": 134}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Okay, this is a friend's hoodie that she texted me and said I have sunscreen all over my brand new hoodie. It's been washed and dried and this is how it came out of the dryer. So my first idea is Dawn Power Wash. So let's see. But then my other idea is Lest Oil. So if this doesn't lift it, I'm going to try the Lest Oil. Okay, this is after one round of the Dawn Power Wash, you guys, but I'm going to try it. Should I do another round of Dawn Power Wash? Or I have this stuff, which takes everything out. And it came out. Look at that, you guys. So that was washed, dried, set in sunscreen in this hoodie. Pretty freaking good. We've been trying to figure this out for like years.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Problem"}]}